<%#
  The ops console landing page. Not a chart wall — the questions somebody
  actually opens this to answer, in the order they matter: what needs attention
  now, what have we earned, who is available.
%>
<header class="main-content__header">
  <h1 class="main-content__page-title">Operations</h1>
</header>

<section class="main-content__body">
  <div class="karwan-tiles">
    <a class="karwan-tile <%= "karwan-tile--alert" if @overdue_orders.positive? %>" href="<%= admin_orders_path(search: "") %>">
      <span class="karwan-tile__number"><%= @overdue_orders %></span>
      <span class="karwan-tile__label">orders overdue</span>
    </a>
    <%# A push that reached nobody. The one tile whose remedy is a telephone. %>
    <a class="karwan-tile <%= "karwan-tile--alert" if @merchants_to_ring.positive? %>" href="<%= admin_audit_logs_path %>">
      <span class="karwan-tile__number"><%= @merchants_to_ring %></span>
      <span class="karwan-tile__label">shops to ring — alert not delivered</span>
    </a>
    <a class="karwan-tile <%= "karwan-tile--warn" if @unassigned_orders.positive? %>" href="<%= admin_orders_path %>">
      <span class="karwan-tile__number"><%= @unassigned_orders %></span>
      <span class="karwan-tile__label">orders with no courier</span>
    </a>
    <a class="karwan-tile" href="<%= admin_orders_path %>">
      <span class="karwan-tile__number"><%= @live_orders %></span>
      <span class="karwan-tile__label">orders live</span>
    </a>
    <a class="karwan-tile <%= "karwan-tile--alert" if @overdue_trips.positive? %>" href="<%= admin_trips_path %>">
      <span class="karwan-tile__number"><%= @live_trips %></span>
      <span class="karwan-tile__label">rides live (<%= @overdue_trips %> overdue)</span>
    </a>
    <a class="karwan-tile" href="<%= admin_courier_profiles_path %>">
      <span class="karwan-tile__number"><%= @couriers_on_shift %></span>
      <span class="karwan-tile__label">couriers on shift</span>
    </a>
    <a class="karwan-tile <%= "karwan-tile--warn" if @couriers_pending.positive? %>" href="<%= admin_courier_profiles_path %>">
      <span class="karwan-tile__number"><%= @couriers_pending %></span>
      <span class="karwan-tile__label">couriers awaiting approval</span>
    </a>
    <a class="karwan-tile" href="<%= admin_merchants_path %>">
      <span class="karwan-tile__number"><%= @merchants_open %>/<%= @merchants_total %></span>
      <span class="karwan-tile__label">merchants open</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <h2>Money</h2>
  <%# Grouped by currency, never summed across it. %>
  <table class="karwan-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Measure</th><th>Currency</th><th>Amount</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <% @commission_today.each do |currency, amount| %>
        <tr><td>Commission today</td><td><%= currency %></td><td><%= amount %></td></tr>
      <% end %>
      <% @commission_week.each do |currency, amount| %>
        <tr><td>Commission, 7 days</td><td><%= currency %></td><td><%= amount %></td></tr>
      <% end %>
      <% @cash_outstanding.each do |currency, amount| %>
        <tr class="karwan-row--warn">
          <td>Cash couriers are holding (our exposure)</td><td><%= currency %></td><td><%= amount %></td>
        </tr>
      <% end %>
      <% if @commission_today.empty? && @commission_week.empty? && @cash_outstanding.empty? %>
        <tr><td colspan="3">Nothing yet.</td></tr>
      <% end %>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <%#
    MARGIN SO FAR, NOT MARGIN BOOKED — and it is said on the screen rather than
    only in a commit message, because these figures get read before the code
    does and a number that quietly means something else is how a market gets
    mispriced.

    A delivery's courier fee depends on the vehicle that takes it, and nobody
    knows which vehicle that is until a courier accepts. So an unassigned order
    has a customer total but no final payout: a bicycle on the same run leaves
    more margin than a zarang. The commission above is settled and exact; the
    delivery margin on live orders is not yet decided.
  %>
  <p class="karwan-note">
    Commission is settled. <strong>Delivery margin on live orders is “so far”, not booked</strong> —
    a courier’s fee depends on the vehicle that takes the job, and that is only known once
    somebody accepts.
  </p>

  <h2>Last ten interventions</h2>
  <%# Every one names the admin who did it. That is a one-way door in
      CLAUDE.md, and this is where it becomes visible. %>
  <table class="karwan-table">
    <thead><tr><th>When</th><th>Action</th><th>By</th><th>Target</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <% @recent_interventions.each do |log| %>
        <tr>
          <td><%= log.created_at.strftime("%d %b %H:%M") %></td>
          <td><%= log.action %></td>
          <td><%= log.author %></td>
          <td><%= [ log.target_type, log.target_id ].compact.join(" #") %></td>
        </tr>
      <% end %>
      <% if @recent_interventions.empty? %>
        <tr><td colspan="4">No interventions recorded.</td></tr>
      <% end %>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>
